+# Record clearance tracker — Illinois (example ruleset)
+
+As of **2026-11-07** · ruleset IL v2026-11-example
+
+## Expungement petition — Possession of a controlled substance (fictional) (C1) · DATA_NEEDED
+
+- [x] No pending criminal cases — pendingCases = false `IL-CR1`
+- [?] All fines paid — client.finesPaid not provided `IL-CR1`
+- [x] Offense eligible for expungement — category/class not in exclusion list `IL-CR1`
+- [x] 3-year waiting period after sentence — 3 years from 2020-07-01; satisfied 2023-07-01 `IL-CR1`
+- Earliest filing: **2023-07-01**
+- Forms: Expungement petition (illustrative form name — verify locally) · Notice to State's Attorney (illustrative)
+  1. Obtain a certified disposition for each conviction (illustrative).
+  2. Verify eligibility against the exclusion list before drafting.
+  3. File the expungement petition with the circuit clerk and serve the State's Attorney.
+  4. Attend the hearing if the court requires it.
+- Fee waiver: A fee-waiver application may be filed with the petition (illustrative — verify locally).
+- Authority: 20 ILCS 2630/5.2 (expungement) — illustrative [verify] — https://www.illinoiscourts.gov/
+
+## Sealing petition — Possession of a controlled substance (fictional) (C1) · READY_TO_FILE
+
+- [x] No pending cases — pendingCases = false `IL-CR2`
+- [x] At most 2 qualifying convictions — 1 conviction(s); cap 2 `IL-CR2`
+- [x] 3 years since sentence completion — 3 years from 2020-07-01; satisfied 2023-07-01 `IL-CR2`
+- Earliest filing: **2023-07-01**
+- Forms: Sealing petition (illustrative form name — verify locally) · Fingerprint card receipt (illustrative)
+  1. Obtain a certified rap sheet listing all convictions (illustrative).
+  2. Confirm the conviction-count cap before filing.
+  3. File the sealing petition with the circuit clerk and serve required parties.
+  4. Calendar the objection window and any hearing date.
+- Fee waiver: A fee-waiver application is available from the circuit clerk (illustrative — verify locally).
+- Authority: 20 ILCS 2630/5.5 (sealing) — illustrative [verify] — https://www.illinoiscourts.gov/
+
+---
+> ⚠️ Example rulesets only. Prerequisites marked unknown need court records before any determination; verify everything with counsel or a legal aid clinic before filing.
